        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Isabel Lucas, Natasha \"Tasha\" Hunter\n- Characters: Tasha Andrews\n- Works: Home and Away, Daybreakers, The Pacific, Immortals, Red Dawn\n- Roles: actress, model\n\nFacts:\n- Isabel Lucas was born on 29 January 1985 and is an Australian actress and model.\n- Isabel Lucas played Natasha \"Tasha\" Hunter, also called Tasha Andrews, in the Australian soap opera Home and Away.\n- Natasha \"Tasha\" Hunter is a fictional character from Home and Away.\n- Isabel Lucas is best known for roles in Home and Away from 2003 to 2006.\n- Isabel Lucas is also known for roles in Daybreakers in 2009, The Pacific in 2010, Immortals in 2011, and Red Dawn in 2012.",
